00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.150
Brown and Alizarin Crimson.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.580
And we'll make some happy little clouds floating around up here in the sky.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:49.820
So let's go right along here and we'll start with a little cloud

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.180
